        "SignificantEvents": "Conditions for active fire behavior and fire growth persist but has been focused in the NE portion of the fire.  Isolated heat/smoke/torching in other areas where hot/dry/unstable conditions bring latent heat to life. Active fire behavior remains driven  by fuel conditions, diurnal winds, and high instability. Timber fuel types drive large fire growth.  ",
