        "PlannedActions": "Mop-up and patrol operations continue across all divisions, with the heaviest effort still concentrated along the eastern perimeter.  Crews also continue to seek and destroy remaining heat, and new fire starts triggered by nightly thunderstorms.  Suppression work and road repair remain ongoing, and resources that no longer match operational needs are being released.  The Woodenshoe Spike camp is scheduled to be closed and will be fully broken down tomorrow.",
