        "ProjectedIncidentActivity24": "Thunderstorm activity continues. Limited fire activity with minimal growth possible. New IA?s possible from the lightning over the last few days.",
        "ProjectedIncidentActivity48": "Thunderstorm activity continues. Increased humidity and shower activity will result in limited fire spread. Limited growth expected",
