        "PlannedActions": "Operationally, crews on the west, north, and south flank will remain in patrol status and maintain situational awareness across the division.  \n\nSeeding, suppression repair and road repair continue across the fire. Planning for hazard tree removal and preparation for potential timber salvage project will begin. \n\nOngoing coordination with local road departments to repair flash-flood-related damage and washouts to ensure access routes into the fire area remain open and safe.\n\nMaintain closures and public safety measures across the Monticello Ranger District, Bears Ears National Monument, and Canyonlands Needles District that remain in effect to support operations.",
