        "ProjectedIncidentActivity24": "Mostly sunny (30-40 percent). Slight chance of rain showers through the day. Slight chance of thunderstorms in the afternoon. Gusty and erratic winds expected near thunderstorms in the afternoon. Limited fire activity with growth unlikely. Possible new IA from lightning yesterday.",
